      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, I've seen this one happen. And not only that you can't see them. You can't see them even in the social list.\nIt's not like that other bug where you can see them in the social list but you can't see their avatar. In that case you can select their avatar if you know where to point and then hide and show their avatar.\nThis new bug requires them to try to re-join the world. And even then on one occasion it didn't work and they had to re-join again. Also anyone joining after they joined will see them.",
